     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem series-type</b></p><a name=\"series-type\"> </a><a name=\"hcseries-type\"> </a><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>http://fhirfli.dev/fhir/ig/cicada/CodeSystem/series-type</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">standard<a name=\"series-type-standard\"> </a></td><td>Standard</td><td>The routine, age-based series.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">risk<a name=\"series-type-risk\"> </a></td><td>Risk</td><td>A series indicated by a patient risk condition, such as travel, occupation, pregnancy, or a chronic medical condition.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">evaluation-only<a name=\"series-type-evaluation-only\"> </a></td><td>Evaluation Only</td><td>A series used only to evaluate administered doses; it never produces a forecast.</td></tr></table></div>"
  ] ;
